+---
+id: def-qftx-critical-abelian-higgs-divisor-data
+kind: definition
+title: Critical Abelian Higgs fields, winding and divisor data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+deps: [def-axiom-of-choice]
+dependency_roles:
